ont-weight:bold&quot;&gt;✘&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td align=&quot;center&quot; style=&quot;color:#d71920;font-weight:bold&quot;&gt;✘&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Helvetica;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#16a34a;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="580" y="170" width="960" height="390" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="3 9" value="Kombinasyonlar: kim hangi projede ne yapabilir?" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Helvetica;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#d71920;dashed=0;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=14;spacingTop=6;fontStyle=1;fontSize=14;fontColor=#d71920;strokeWidth=2;arcSize=3;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="620" width="1520" height="540" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="3 10" value="&lt;table cellpadding=&quot;7&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; border=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;font-size:12px;border-color:#9ca3af&quot;&gt;&lt;tr style=&quot;background:#d71920;color:#fff&quot;&gt;&lt;th align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;Şirket rolü \ Projedeki rol&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th&gt;Rolü yok&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th&gt;Viewer&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th&gt;Contributor&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th&gt;Team Lead&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th&gt;Project Manager&lt;/th&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr style=&quot;background:#e8f1ff&quot;&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;b&gt;Admin&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td align=&quot;center&quot;&gt;Tam yetki&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td align=&quot;center&quot;&gt;Tam yetki&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td align=&quot;center&quot;&gt;Tam yetki&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td align=&quot;center&quot;&gt;Tam yetki&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td align=&quot;center&quot;&gt;Tam yetki&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr style=&quot;background:#fff6e0&quot;&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;b&gt;Executive&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td align=&quot;center&quot;&gt;Sadece okur&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td align=&quot;center&quot;&gt;Sadece okur&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td align=&quot;center&quot;&gt;Okur + görev oluşturur, kendi görevini düzenler&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td align=&quot;center&quot;&gt;Tüm görev, epic, story, sprint&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td align=&quot;center&quot;&gt;Projede tam yetki&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr style=&quot;background:#ffffff&quot;&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;b&gt;Member&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td align=&quot;center&quot;&gt;Projeyi göremez&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td align=&quot;center&quot;&gt;Sadece okur&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td align=&quot;center&quot;&gt;Görev oluşturur, kendi görevini düzenler&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td align=&quot;center&quot;&gt;Tüm görev, epic, story, sprint&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td align=&quot;center&quot;&gt;Projede tam yetki&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Helvetica;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#d71920;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="670" width="1480" height="200" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="3 11" value="&lt;b&gt;Yönetim ekranları (yalnızca Admin)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Members &amp;amp; Roles → Users: şirket rolü değiştirme&lt;br&gt;• Permissions: rol yetkilerini düzenleme (Save ile)&lt;br&gt;• Allowed email addresses: izin listesi&lt;br&gt;• Audit log: kim ne yaptı" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Helvetica;fillColor=#fdecec;strokeColor=#d71920;strokeWidth=1.5;shadow=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="900" width="480" height="230" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="3 12" value="&lt;b&gt;Denetim iki katmanlıdır&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Sunucu (Firestore kuralları): kim okur, yazar, siler&lt;br&gt;Uygulama (permViolation): görev ve epic gibi ince yetkiler&lt;br&gt;Yetkisiz değişiklik geri alınır ve uyarı çıkar" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Helvetica;fillColor=#fff6e0;strokeColor=#d97706;strokeWidth=1.5;shadow=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="580" y="900" width="470" height="230" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="3 13" value="&lt;b&gt;Dikkat edilecekler&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Kendi projesini kuran herkes orada PM olur&lt;br&gt;• &quot;Kendi görevi&quot; = Assignee adı / e-postası eşleşen&lt;br&gt;• İnce yetkiler (görev, epic) yalnızca uygulamada denetlenir&lt;br&gt;• View all / Create / Import / Export / Manage users kutucukları bilgi amaçlıdır" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Helvetica;fillColor=#f3f4f6;strokeColor=#667085;strokeWidth=1.5;shadow=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1090" y="900" width="450" height="230" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram id="4 diagram" name="4 - Davet ve Giriş Akışı"><mxGraphModel dx="1400" dy="900" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1600" pageHeight="1100" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="4 2" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:22px&quot;&gt;Davet ve Giriş Akışı&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12px;color:#ffe3e3&quot;&gt;Yalnızca davetle giriş: izin listesi + e-posta doğrulaması olmadan veri görünmez&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Helvetica;fillColor=#d71920;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#ffffff;align=left;spacingLeft=20;arcSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="20" width="1540" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="4 3" value="&lt;b&gt;1. PM veya Admin&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Members → e-posta + proje rolü yazar" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Helvetica;fillColor=#e8f1ff;strokeColor=#2f6fed;strokeWidth=1.5;shadow=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="150" width="260" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="4 4" value="&lt;b&gt;2. Firestore&#x27;a yazılır&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;allowlist/{email} + invites/{proje_email}" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Helvetica;fillColor=#fff6e0;strokeColor=#d97706;strokeWidt